        - Redis TTL client retry window + exponential backoff ko dhyan me rakh kar define karte hain.
        - Generally retry window 24 hours se zyada nahi hoti, isliye Redis TTL 24h rakhte hain.


      ### QUESTION : DB KA ROLE ?
    ---------------------------------
        - DB durable source of truth hai.
        - 90 days tak record DB me rakhte hain. Uske baad cleanup job usse delete kar deta hai.
